lackbeard and buggy both of whom are  now emperors of the sea now of course  blackbeard is on paper much stronger  than buggy so if some sort of conflict  goes down between them blackbeard is the  heavy favorite to win but at the same  time you simply cannot count buggy out  the man is extremely crafty and  extremely lucky so you can't  underestimate him personally i'm pretty  confident that the shanks theory is true  and that shanks comes from a prominent  family of celestial dragons as for buggy  his secret origins are far less apparent  but the theory that he might be the son  of zebec and the brother of blackbeard  could make for some interesting family  drama during the final saga of the story  and if it's true that shanks is a  celestial dragon and buggy was the son  of zebek just imagine what roger could  have been planning when he decided to  take both of them in so much of  everything that has come to pass in the  one piece world was planned by roger and  i honestly can't wait to get to laugh  tale and learn the full truth about  roger's master plans  what do you guys think is shanks a  celestial dragon and is buggy the son of  zebec could buggy and blackbeard be  brothers or do you have a better theory  about buggy's secret origins and how he  ended up on roger's ship don't forget to  leave your thoughts down in the comments  below i always love hearing from you if  you enjoyed this video and you want us  to keep it coming with that one piece  content leave a like and comment right  now it helps with the youtube algorithm  and if you haven't taken the time to  subscribe yet do me a big favor and  subscribe right now and also hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications that is a completely free  way of directly supporting the channel  and it means a lot on youtube you can  also hit me up on twitter and instagram  at animeopror as always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys
 

